              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Becky Johnson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely loved it. Read some of the other reviews. Used 7 cups chicken broth rather than 8 cups water. I threw in fresh mushrooms. Used white pepper......it was delicious!!! Hubby said to make sure this was a \"keeper.\"",
